   },
   {
    "en": "Aβ = 1 with a total loop phase shift of 0° or 360°"
   },
   {
    "en": "Aβ = −1 with a phase shift of 90°"
   },
   {
    "en": "A = β with any phase shift"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "The returned signal must be exactly as large as, and in phase with, the signal that produced it."
